.TH SYSCAGE 1 "2026-06-27" "SYSCAGE" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
syscage \- Behavioral syscall profiler and seccomp policy generator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B syscage
.B learn
[\fI--duration\fR \fIseconds\fR] \fIcommand\fR...
.br
.B syscage
.B gen
\fIprofile\fR \fI--name\fR \fIname\fR
.br
.B syscage
.B enforce
\fIprofile\fR \fI--pid\fR \fIpid\fR
.br
.B syscage
.B exec
\fIprofile\fR \fIcommand\fR...
.br
.B syscage
.B watch
\fIprofile\fR \fIcommand\fR...
.SH DESCRIPTION
SYSCAGE is a three-phase tool for seccomp-BPF policy management:
.IP 1. 4
\fBlearn\fR: trace syscalls made by a process via ptrace
.IP 2. 4
\fBgen\fR: generate a seccomp profile from the trace data
.IP 3. 4
\fBenforce\fR: inject the seccomp filter into a running process
via ptrace
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B learn \fI--duration\fR \fIseconds\fR \fIcommand\fR...
Trace all syscalls made by the given command for the specified
duration and save the trace to a file.
.TP
.B gen \fIprofile\fR \fI--name\fR \fIname\fR
Generate a seccomp-BPF profile from a saved trace file.
Outputs a C header file for static compilation or a JSON
profile for runtime enforcement.
.TP
.B enforce \fIprofile\fR \fI--pid\fR \fIpid\fR
Inject a seccomp filter into a running process by PID using
ptrace. Requires root.
.TP
.B exec \fIprofile\fR \fIcommand\fR...
Spawn a new process with the seccomp filter applied before
execution.
.TP
.B watch \fIprofile\fR \fIcommand\fR...
Spawn and monitor a process under the seccomp filter, reporting
any SIGSYS seccomp violations.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.B 0
on success, 1 on error.
.SH AUTHOR
Jefferson Cesar Antunes
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR seccomp (2),
.BR ptrace (2),
.BR prctl (2),
.BR kscanner (1),
.BR linspec (1)
